WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:14.937
Meg had awoken when Jo crept out of the room but tried to go back to sleep until

2
00:00:14.998 --> 00:00:19.239
she heard a low moaning that sounded like a wounded animal coming from their parents' room.

3
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:25.182
She was uneasy about the strange noise but something told her it was important to check it out

4
00:00:25.242 --> 00:00:25.762
right away.

5
00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:30.624
What Meg saw as she opened the door would forever be branded in her heart.

6
00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:34.926
"Jo! What's the matter with Beth?"

7
00:00:35.206 --> 00:00:39.850
cried Meg, her knees buckling under her as she caught sight of her unconscious little sister.

8
00:00:40.971 --> 00:00:46.235
Jo tried her best to explain in-between sobs while trying to move Beth under the bed covers.

9
00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:51.840
"She has scarlet fever and it's all my fault," wept Jo.

10
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.662
"Scarlet fever?

11
00:00:54.682 --> 00:01:00.427
How?" Meg asked, rising on shaky feet to help Jo lift Beth so they could make her more

12
00:01:00.487 --> 00:01:08.111
comfortable. "I'll explain later but for now, please call Hannah," gasped Jo, removing Beth's clothes and shoes.

13
00:01:09.231 --> 00:01:15.934
Meg could see the seriousness of the situation, so without another word she ran downstairs to wake Hannah

14
00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:18.075
up. "There, darling.

15
00:01:18.575 --> 00:01:21.016
It's going to be all right," whispered Jo.

16
00:01:21.356 --> 00:01:27.298
Brushing Beth's hair away from her face, Jo felt Beth's hot skin under her hand and heard her

17
00:01:27.358 --> 00:01:28.799
labored, uneven breathing.

18
00:01:29.519 --> 00:01:35.471
As frightened and shaken as she was, Jo heard approaching footsteps and knew instinctively that it wasn't Meg

19
00:01:35.571 --> 00:01:35.992
or Hannah.

20
00:01:37.152 --> 00:01:42.797
Remembering Beth's strong warning, Jo jumped up, flew out the door, and slammed it shut behind her before

21
00:01:42.937 --> 00:01:43.958
Amy could enter the room.

22
00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:46.440
"Jo, what is going on?

23
00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:47.621
Who's in there?

24
00:01:48.001 --> 00:01:48.622
Is it Beth?"

25
00:01:49.062 --> 00:01:51.724
asked Amy, launching one question after another.

26
00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.706
"I heard someone crying.

27
00:01:54.106 --> 00:01:55.067
Jo, was that you?

28
00:01:55.327 --> 00:01:57.129
Your eyes are all red and swollen.

29
00:01:57.769 --> 00:01:58.610
Where's Meg?

30
00:01:58.990 --> 00:01:59.911
Can I go in there?

31
00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:00.992
Is Beth sick?"

32
00:02:02.192 --> 00:02:07.237
"Amy, go back to the bedroom and don't come out 'til Meg or I say so," ordered Jo.

33
00:02:08.358 --> 00:02:11.660
Amy put her hands on her hips and said stubbornly, "No!

34
00:02:12.001 --> 00:02:12.541
I won't!

35
00:02:12.821 --> 00:02:14.663
Not until you tell me what's going on!"

36
00:02:15.524 --> 00:02:19.327
Then she tried to reach for the doorknob, which Jo was covering with her back.

37
00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:22.470
"Amy! Stop being so difficult!

38
00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:25.392
This is for your own good," Jo croaked hoarsely.

39
00:02:25.412 --> 00:02:27.594
"There's no time to explain.

40
00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.456
Get back in the bedroom now!"

41
00:02:30.504 --> 00:02:31.424
"You're not Mother!

42
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:33.065
You can't tell me what to do!

43
00:02:33.405 --> 00:02:34.586
I won't stand for it!

44
00:02:35.146 --> 00:02:36.487
What are you trying to hide?"

45
00:02:37.087 --> 00:02:40.388
Amy cried, wrestling with Jo to get into the forbidden room.

46
00:02:41.509 --> 00:02:47.271
Left with no choice, Jo grabbed Amy forcefully and dragged her back to their bedroom, with Amy kicking

47
00:02:47.311 --> 00:02:48.972
and screaming at the top of her lungs.

48
00:02:50.132 --> 00:02:55.234
Then to ensure that Amy did not sneak out and expose herself to the disease, Jo locked the

49
00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:57.915
door from the outside and put the key in her pocket.

50
00:02:59.932 --> 00:03:00.473
"Let me out!

51
00:03:00.493 --> 00:03:01.674
This is an outrage!"

52
00:03:02.034 --> 00:03:06.978
Amy screamed from inside, rattling the doorknob and pounding the door with her little fists.

53
00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:16.306
"Amy, please, I'll explain everything later," Jo said more gently, "but for now, this is for your own

54
00:03:16.366 --> 00:03:24.233
protection." The short distance back to their parents' room felt extremely exhausting and dispiriting as Jo contemplated the

55
00:03:24.353 --> 00:03:29.754
one sister locked up like a prisoner behind her while the other sister was imprisoned in her own

56
00:03:29.854 --> 00:03:31.436
sick body in the room ahead of her.

57
00:03:32.596 --> 00:03:35.899
Thank goodness Hannah finally appeared to take over the situation.

58
00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:41.724
Though her face was tired, Hannah's eyes were bright with anxiety as she searched for Beth.

59
00:03:42.665 --> 00:03:47.729
"She's in there," Jo said, pointing to her parents' room, "and I've put her under the covers.

60
00:03:48.169 --> 00:03:49.371
She's burning up, Hannah."

61
00:03:49.391 --> 00:03:52.713
"I've called for Dr.

62
00:03:52.753 --> 00:03:55.676
Bangs," Meg told them as they entered the room together.

63
00:03:56.576 --> 00:04:02.919
Wiping a tear with one large hand, Hannah put the other on Beth's red, burning face, saying, "Until

64
00:04:02.959 --> 00:04:08.081
he comes, bring all the towels you can find and fill all the basins with cold water.

65
00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:10.262
We need to bring the fever down.

66
00:04:10.682 --> 00:04:11.823
Hurry, girls, go now!"

67
00:04:13.123 --> 00:04:18.346
After the girls had taken numerous trips upstairs to bring cold water to the bedroom, Dr.

68
00:04:18.366 --> 00:04:19.666
Bangs finally arrived.

69
00:04:20.627 --> 00:04:23.528
He sent the girls out of the room but allowed Hannah to remain.

70
00:04:25.024 --> 00:04:31.567
Exhausted and overwhelmed with guilt, Meg and Jo stood nearby, waiting for the latest news about Beth's condition.

71
00:04:31.587 --> 00:04:35.429
"I take full responsibility," whispered Jo.

72
00:04:35.449 --> 00:04:37.310
"I should have gone.

73
00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.731
I wasn't even feeling sick, just lazy."

74
00:04:41.692 --> 00:04:46.774
Meg shook her head and said, "No, the blame is on me since Mother left me in charge,

75
00:04:47.114 --> 00:04:50.316
which means I should have been the one to visit the Hummels, not Beth."

76
00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:55.283
"Beth said the baby died of the fever, so the other children must have it too.

77
00:04:55.823 --> 00:04:58.825
I wonder how they are doing," Jo asked worriedly.

78
00:04:58.845 --> 00:05:02.588
"Scarlet fever is infectious and spreads rapidly.

79
00:05:03.188 --> 00:05:05.650
You and I are immune, but what about Amy?"

80
00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.672
Meg looked toward their closed bedroom door.

81
00:05:09.652 --> 00:05:13.915
Amy had either given up or gone back to bed, but all was quiet from that part of

82
00:05:13.935 --> 00:05:14.335
the house.

83
00:05:14.355 --> 00:05:17.157
"Meg? Jo?"

84
00:05:17.417 --> 00:05:20.940
Dr. Bangs came out from their parents' room with a long, weary face.

85
00:05:21.896 --> 00:05:22.817
"How is she, Doctor?"

86
00:05:23.137 --> 00:05:27.439
asked Meg, glancing at Hannah, who stood behind the doctor with her head lowered.

87
00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.881
"Not too good, I'm afraid," the doctor said sadly.

88
00:05:30.901 --> 00:05:37.105
"This fever strikes quickly and although all of you did a fine job trying to keep her body

89
00:05:37.145 --> 00:05:40.126
temperature cool, the illness had already taken over."

90
00:05:41.127 --> 00:05:44.829
Jo felt the room spinning as she staggered against the wall for support.

91
00:05:44.849 --> 00:05:47.751
"Should we send for Mother?"

92
00:05:48.291 --> 00:05:49.912
Meg asked in a shaking voice.

93
00:05:51.052 --> 00:05:52.613
"Not yet," said Hannah.

94
00:05:53.494 --> 00:05:57.096
"We won't know how the little angel is until the morning, will we, Dr.

95
00:05:57.136 --> 00:05:59.958
Bangs?" "That's right," said Dr.

96
00:05:59.998 --> 00:06:05.782
Bangs. "I've given her some medicine to reduce the fever and I'll return the first thing in the

97
00:06:05.823 --> 00:06:07.083
morning to check up on her.

98
00:06:07.804 --> 00:06:12.867
Meanwhile," he added as he headed downstairs, "all of you should try to get some rest."

99
00:06:15.069 --> 00:06:18.992
"Dr. Bangs," called Jo, "the Hummel children have the fever, too.

100
00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.821
That's where Beth got it from."

101
00:06:20.841 --> 00:06:22.322
"I know, Jo.

102
00:06:22.962 --> 00:06:26.284
I'm just going there now," the doctor replied and smiled kindly.

103
00:06:26.304 --> 00:06:28.125
"I'll let you know how they are."

104
00:06:28.965 --> 00:06:33.808
Hannah followed him down, noting his instructions about what to do in an emergency.

105
00:06:34.568 --> 00:06:39.411
Meg and Jo went back inside to Beth, who was still red all over but now had a

106
00:06:39.471 --> 00:06:40.632
rash all over her face.

107
00:06:41.392 --> 00:06:44.994
Her uneven breathing and the pain on her face broke their hearts.

108
00:06:45.014 --> 00:06:46.535
"Oh, Beth.

109
00:06:46.915 --> 00:06:50.742
I'm so sorry," cried Meg, holding onto one of Beth's hands.

110
00:06:50.762 --> 00:06:53.144
"Beth, please get better.

111
00:06:53.584 --> 00:06:55.906
I promise not to be so selfish anymore.

112
00:06:56.487 --> 00:06:58.548
I'll visit the Hummels every day from now on.

113
00:06:59.049 --> 00:07:02.592
Just get better," Jo said, her voice breaking with emotion.

114
00:07:03.753 --> 00:07:08.356
They sat there like that for the whole night, neither wanting to leave their sister's side.

115
00:07:09.657 --> 00:07:16.223
As the sun rose, Beth's condition did not change, forcing them to face the unbearable question they had

116
00:07:16.283 --> 00:07:17.544
tried to avoid all night.

117
00:07:18.441 --> 00:07:23.333
With red-rimmed eyes, Jo turned to her sister and asked in a trembling voice,
